 StyleBox[" ",
  FontSize->18],
 StyleBox["is used as an input to \[OpenCurlyQuote]reaction_outside\
\[CloseCurlyQuote] in the code.\n\nWe solve for A and k from the following \
two equations:\n1. s(",
  FontSize->18,
  FontTracking->"Plain",
  FontColor->RGBColor[0.6, 0.4, 0.2]],
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["c", "out"], TraditionalForm]],
