Cell["\<\
        (2*Diff*Pi*((A - cfar*k)*\[Xi] + (-A + \
cEqOut*k)*R*(BesselI(1,R/\[Xi])*BesselK(0,(L + R)/\[Xi]) + BesselI(0,(L + R)/\
\[Xi])*BesselK(1,R/\[Xi]))))/
     -  (k*\[Xi]*(BesselI(0,(L + R)/\[Xi])*BesselK(0,R/\[Xi]) - BesselI(0,R/\
\[Xi])*BesselK(0,(L + R)/\[Xi])))\
\>", "Output",
